  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection et Assistances Multisectorielles en faveur des R&#xE9;fugi&#xE9;s et Populations H&#xF4;tes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this UNHCR project is to provide protection assistance to Sudanese refugees and local host communities in the northeast of the Central African Republic. The project relocates 10,400 refugees and 4,700 returnees away from the border (if they choose to do so), registers the 10,400 newly arrived refugees as asylum-seekers and carries out protection monitoring, among other activities. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 15,100 people, including 3,800 women, 750 men, 10,500 children, and including 1,500 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
